{
 "encounter_id": "00958",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um, hi. I twisted my ankle playing football last night. It's, um, swollen, and I'm not sure if I should have come, my mates said I'm being soft."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Not soft at all. Tell me what happened."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I went to tackle someone and my foot got stuck in the turf and sort of rolled outwards. It went, um, on the outside of the left ankle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "When was this? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yesterday evening, about eight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And how's it been since?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It swelled up quickly, like an egg, on the outside."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any bruising?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's gone a bit purple this morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you hear a crack or a snap?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um, no. No crack. Just a sort of pull."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any numbness or tingling in the foot?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No numbness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain higher up, in the shin or the knee?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, it's only the ankle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What have you taken?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, three times a day. Paracetamol, 1 gram, when it's bad. Cetirizine, 10 mg, every morning. And my blue inhaler, salbutamol, when I need it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Um. I think I came out in a rash once from some tablets I got abroad, in Spain. I don't know what they were."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine, I'll note it as possible. Any health conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, and hay fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had my left knee done, the cruciate, in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything in the family I should know about?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My dad has arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a student, final year."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often do you play football?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Twice a week. Saturdays and Wednesdays."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "At weekends, a few pints."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse 72, blood pressure 118 over 74, temperature 36.7, oxygen 99 percent, breathing 14, weight 74 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that okay? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Perfect. Let me look at the ankle. Tell me if it hurts.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ah. There. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's swelling and tenderness over the ligaments on the outside of the left ankle, but no tenderness over the bony bumps."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that good? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's good. And you can take a few steps, I watched you come in. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yeah, limping, but I could. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any wheeze or chest tightness today?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing. My chest is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So here's what I think. This looks like a sprained ankle, a ligament sprain, probably a moderate one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it broken? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Unlikely, given you could walk and there's no bony tenderness. But I'd like to arrange an X-ray of the ankle to be sure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And I'd like to arrange an ultrasound of the ankle ligaments, to see how much damage there is."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "How long will I be out? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A few weeks. I'd like to arrange physiotherapy to get you back faster."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rest, ice, compression and elevation for the first few days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Got it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you can't put your weight on it by next week, come back and see me."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, thanks, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
